                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Celecoxib 200 mg capsule and etoricoxib 60 mg, 90 mg and 120 mg tablets are recommended for inclusion on the MOH Standard Drug List (SDL) for the abovementioned indication."
